WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:05,910
Drinks are useless and the lathe cannot be used for the time being.

2
00:00:05,910 --> 00:00:08,710
There are more and more houses, and space is getting tighter and tighter.

3
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:10,910
The most practical way to expand capacity is to choose three.

4
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:15,460
The selection is successful. The system space has been increased from 400 cubic meters to

5
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:17,060
Increased to 500 cubic meters

6
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:23,130
It smells so good. Su Hao, what are you doing?

7
00:00:23,130 --> 00:00:29,410
It’s delicious, better than the ones made in big restaurants

8
00:00:29,410 --> 00:00:33,600
Controlling the fire with mind power is accurate, the heat is just right and there is no blur at all.

9
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:40,690
Eat quickly. After eating, we still have business to do.

10
00:00:40,690 --> 00:00:42,690
Our golden jujubes are getting thicker again

11
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:44,290
Why is your family background so rich?

12
00:00:44,890 --> 00:00:47,290
Good thing, put stuff in the back

13
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:48,890
No need to be so fussy anymore

14
00:00:48,890 --> 00:00:53,830
Tried tomatoes, cabbage, cucumbers

15
00:00:53,830 --> 00:00:55,630
Fully alive and full of energy

16
00:00:55,630 --> 00:00:57,430
It seems that these three cheap vegetables are not poisonous

17
00:00:57,430 --> 00:00:58,830
The amount last night was safe

18
00:00:58,830 --> 00:01:00,830
Su Hao, don't worry, just take it away.
